\newlabel{fig:appendix-stability}{{3}{18}{Stability score analysis across LLMs on ShareGPT structured output tasks. (a) Box plots showing the distribution of $S_{\alpha }$ for all 18 evaluated models, ordered by median stability. The gradient coloring (red to green) reflects ranking. (b) Temperature degradation curves for five representative models: Claude-Opus-4.5 (most capable proprietary), Qwen3-235B-A22B (most capable open-source), GPT-4.1-Mini (cost-effective), Grok-4.1-Fast (fast inference), and Nova-2-Lite (AWS). Higher temperature generally reduces stability, though degradation patterns vary by model architecture}{figure.3}{}}
